{
  "_comment": [
    "Ring priority for biscuit. A HIGHER layer wins; within a layer, a LOWER rank wins.",
    "A name absent from this table gets layer 0 rank 999, below everything listed here.",
    "That is how generated fx_* effects sit under voice and volume activity without",
    "being enumerated. Ranks are dense and carry no meaning beyond their order.",
    "Names sharing a rank are alternative spellings of one activity across the LED",
    "maps, and are deliberately equal rather than merely adjacent.",
    "Notes live here and not in priorities, because _mic-mute is a real activity and",
    "an underscore-means-comment rule would silently drop it."
  ],
